@PaymentsModule_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@BearerToken = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_JWT

### 1. Open cash shift (201 Created / 409 Conflict if already open)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash-shifts/open
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fondo_inicial": 500.00
}

### 2. Get real-time cash shift summary / arqueo (200 OK / 404 Not Found if no open shift)
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash-shifts/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

### 3. Close cash shift (200 OK / 422 Unprocessable Entity if no open shift)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash-shifts/close
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "efectivo_declarado": 2500.00
}

